# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .gitignore — github.com/georgelza/flink-connector-prometheus
#
# This repository is SOURCE ONLY. The shaded connector jar is a build artefact
# that a consumer (IoTStream) copies into its Flink image's lib/ — it does not
# belong here, and neither does anything Maven writes into target/.
#
# The previous rules were per-module and two of them were wrong:
#   · one named `flink-prometheus-connector`, but the directory is
#     `flink-connector-prometheus`, so it matched nothing
#   · two had malformed globs (`/**//*.jar`, `//**/*.class`)
# Generic patterns cover every module now, including ones added later.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Maven build output — every module, every depth ──────────────────────────
**/target/
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear

# Generated by maven-shade-plugin / flatten-maven-plugin, written next to pom.xml
dependency-reduced-pom.xml
.flattened-pom.xml

# Surefire / Failsafe reports (also inside target/, belt and braces)
**/surefire-reports/
**/failsafe-reports/

# ── Binaries for programs and plugins ───────────────────────────────────────
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# ── Archives and data files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.tar.gz
*.parquet
*.avro

# ── Test / coverage output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.test
*.out
*.log

# ── Editor and OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.swp

# ── Credentials ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# No secrets belong in this repository. If a local build needs them, use
# environment variables or a file under ~/.m2, never a committed file.
.env
*.pwd
